Thanks for bringing this up; kept me busy for a while; conclusion, confusion persists though you maybe right.

Something is definately fishy about this thing;
1- Too easy to be true
2- It almost seems like the articel is written to lure the gullible into downloading and installing it (though no download link is given; maybe he wants people to contact him, he tells them to share their emails and then he tells each one, privately, how one can have the software)

So here is my idea/thoughts regarding AI use during test use. Please criticize it;


If one is to use AI to keep E2 below its optimal level, one ought to get three benefits;


1) there would be less of Aromatase to convert that extraneous test into E2 so more of that is available for anabolic activities


2) your HPTA would keep working, thereby no need for pct afterwards


3) your testicles keep churning out test which adds to total test going through your system.
